{"v":4,"catch":"激烈的槍戰 射擊機槍！","desc":"\"LEAD ANGLE \"是一款由 SEIBU KAIHATSU 於 1988 年推出的槍械射擊遊戲。\n您要控制主角 GEORGE PHOENIX，與幫派份子作鬥爭。\n使用手槍、手榴彈、機關槍和霰彈槍打敗最後階段的大老闆「KING」。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-09-05","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2503bd5826d7a45099b3957ce8559512a65b0d89eb265bbbae71ab3b4ccb71ea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f60ee381c0fc93b2c3feaf1ecace4b9c8412f1188b3bef951d6a1d71231f26ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de6aa16715c84c01b609b1bbee15b73c7ef9cb9094aeb1651a2370117a1f7bf4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa48314ae7267dc65d80991d682d9fc212c6f6e1c6b947c0a10faa05b0922bdb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8aa10c892dc6a9a47c793732b88bebebbdc00e56b1fdc4391efc38b01c283e78.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b67b858758fe4d8a69546043d7919edbd257677936081b4543e3121d984c804a.jpg"],"titleId":"010086801f62c000","dlc":[]}